# AGL project base — baseline agent rules

Source of truth for AI instructions: `.ai-governance/` (versioned with this repository).

Before generating or modifying code, read and follow:

1. **Security** — `.ai-governance/global-security-policy.md`
   - No secrets in source; never commit `.env`
   - Do not store tokens in `localStorage` or `sessionStorage`
   - Validate inputs; restrict CORS; do not leak internals in errors

2. **Architecture** — `.ai-governance/architectural-standards.md`
   - Node/Express only; entry `src/index.js`; default port 4000
   - Generated application code stays in `/src/`
   - REST under `/api/`; keep `GET /api/health`

Do not invent a second app tree or add frameworks without an approved architecture change.
